.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-plans-merge-plan-metadata - Merge plan metadata


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago plans merge-plan-metadata  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
This endpoint merges the provided metadata with existing metadata on the plan.
Existing keys not in the request are preserved. New keys are added, existing keys are updated.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for merge-plan-metadata

.PP
\fB--input\fP=""
	Complete JSON request body or @file.json


